    "2120126708988748077": {
      "author": "Adellbah",
      "context": "OXMallam resume el caso Coldcard: según su post, un error de compilación de marzo de 2021 debilitó la generación de semillas (≈40 bits en Mk2/Mk3, ≈72 bits en Mk4/Mk5/Q) y unos 1.816 BTC (~$116M) salieron de más de 5.200 direcciones; actualizar el firmware no basta, hay que crear una semilla nueva; las semillas hechas con al menos 50 tiradas de dados no se consideran vulnerables a esta falla.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:09:32Z",
      "created_at_chile": "2026-11-10 09:09:32 America/Santiago",
      "created_at_verified": true,
      "cta": "",
      "exclude_reason": "",
      "first_seen_at": "2026-11-10T13:22:41.782876+00:00",
      "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-10T13:22:41+00:00",
      "followers_count": 30353,
      "followers_count_verified": true,
      "followers_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids.includes.users.public_metrics.followers_count",
      "id": "2120126708988748077",
      "language": "en",
      "last_seen_at": "2026-11-10T13:22:41.782876+00:00",
      "qualification": {
        "age_seconds": 4389.783,
        "exclude_reason": "",
        "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-10T13:22:41+00:00",
        "followers_count": 30353,
        "followers_count_verified": true,
        "min_followers_exclusive": 20000,
        "qualified": true,
        "window_seconds": 7200
      },
      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2120126708988748077",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2120126708988748077&text=The%20part%20that%20stuck%20with%20me%20is%20the%20exception%3A%20seeds%20made%20with%20enough%20fair%20dice%20rolls%20weren%27t%20exposed%20to%20this%20flaw.%20Entropy%20you%20generate%20and%20can%20check%20yourself%20beats%20entropy%20you%20have%20to%20trust%20a%20vendor%20for.%20That%27s%20the%20core%20of%20the%20air-gapped%20setup%20I%20describe%20here%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fforecastquant%2Fstatus%2F2119476332635586800",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "The part that stuck with me is the exception: seeds made with enough fair dice rolls weren't exposed to this flaw. Entropy you generate and can check yourself beats entropy you have to trust a vendor for. That's the core of the air-gapped setup I describe here: https://x.com/forecastquant/status/2119476332635586800",
      "timestamp_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids",
      "topic": "custodia",
      "url": "https://x.com/Adellbah/status/2120126708988748077"
    },
    "2120131906415292573": {
      "author": "ChartsBtc",
      "context": "ChartsBTC (bot de gráficos) publica el power law de hoy: precio $74.148, precio del modelo $145.537, «49.05% below trend», «736 days behind trend»; la fecha power law para el precio actual sería 2024-11-04.",
