      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2120131906415292573",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2120131906415292573&text=Being%2049%25%20below%20the%20trend%20line%20sounds%20like%20a%20discount%2C%20but%20the%20model%20has%20spent%20long%20stretches%20far%20under%20that%20line%20before.%20The%20line%20is%20the%20center%2C%20not%20the%20floor%2C%20so%20I%20look%20at%20the%20corridor%20around%20it%20rather%20than%20the%20gap%20to%20one%20number.%20How%20I%20read%20it%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fforecastquant%2Fstatus%2F2118779927340470279",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "Being 49% below the trend line sounds like a discount, but the model has spent long stretches far under that line before. The line is the center, not the floor, so I look at the corridor around it rather than the gap to one number. How I read it: https://x.com/forecastquant/status/2118779927340470279",
